WEBVTT

1
00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:24.235
come alive with the other statues in the moonlight," Mabel gently explained to Kathleen.

2
00:00:24.255 --> 00:00:27.737
"Why aren't you afraid of me?"

3
00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:29.118
asked Kathleen.

4
00:00:29.138 --> 00:00:32.520
"I have the ring," said Mabel.

5
00:00:33.268 --> 00:00:36.210
"Maybe we can find out more about this magic place.

6
00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.312
That is, if the other statues will talk to us."

7
00:00:40.912 --> 00:00:44.114
"Apollo was very nice," said Kathleen.

8
00:00:44.134 --> 00:00:46.396
"He's swimming in the lake now."

9
00:00:49.057 --> 00:00:53.019
The girls walked to the lake and sat on the grass to wait for Apollo.

10
00:00:57.682 --> 00:01:00.844
little sister," said Apollo, emerging from the lake.

11
00:01:02.456 --> 00:01:03.257
"Who's your friend?"

12
00:01:03.277 --> 00:01:08.600
"This is Mabel," said Kathleen.

13
00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:13.042
"How can you see us, and why aren't you afraid?"

14
00:01:13.523 --> 00:01:14.283
asked Apollo.

15
00:01:15.824 --> 00:01:17.165
Mabel showed him the ring.

16
00:01:17.185 --> 00:01:19.606
"Now I understand.

17
00:01:19.986 --> 00:01:22.027
You should become a statue and swim with us."

18
00:01:22.047 --> 00:01:26.270
"I can't swim," said Mabel.

19
00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.432
"Me neither," said Kathleen.

20
00:01:31.156 --> 00:01:34.358
"You can swim," Apollo said to Kathleen.

21
00:01:34.378 --> 00:01:38.781
"All statues that come to life are excellent swimmers."

22
00:01:40.383 --> 00:01:43.024
Again he urged Mabel to become a statue.

23
00:01:43.044 --> 00:01:47.127
"This ring she said hesitantly.

24
00:01:47.147 --> 00:01:51.570
"You wish for things and you never know how long they'll last."

25
00:01:53.031 --> 00:01:56.834
Apollo explained that she must set a time limit on the ring's powers.

26
00:01:56.854 --> 00:02:02.490
"We'll swim to the island and feast with the gods," he said.

27
00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:06.011
"Oh, I'm so hungry!"

28
00:02:06.592 --> 00:02:07.432
said Kathleen.

29
00:02:07.452 --> 00:02:08.993
"Do it, Mabel!"

30
00:02:10.514 --> 00:02:13.256
So Mabel decided to become a statue.

31
00:02:14.736 --> 00:02:17.218
First she removed her shoes and stockings.

32
00:02:18.699 --> 00:02:20.700
She didn't think they'd look nice in marble!

33
00:02:22.401 --> 00:02:27.864
Then she said, "I wish I could be a statue of living marble until dawn.

34
00:02:28.368 --> 00:02:30.330
After that I want to return to normal."

35
00:02:32.972 --> 00:02:34.593
Mabel turned into a statue.

36
00:02:35.394 --> 00:02:38.456
Apollo and the girls ran to the lake and jumped in.

37
00:02:39.557 --> 00:02:42.580
The girls were delighted that they could swim with ease.

38
00:02:45.022 --> 00:02:48.344
When they reached the island, Apollo led them to a pool.

39
00:02:49.565 --> 00:02:52.908
All around the pool were statues of gods and goddesses.

40
00:02:53.989 --> 00:02:55.410
And they were all alive.

41
00:02:56.671 --> 00:02:57.652
Some were dancing.

42
00:02:59.576 --> 00:03:01.798
Some were splashing their feet in the pool.

43
00:03:03.959 --> 00:03:05.680
Apollo introduced the girls.

44
00:03:07.361 --> 00:03:10.003
A goddess placed a wreath on everyone's head.

45
00:03:12.365 --> 00:03:13.846
Then the feast began.

46
00:03:13.866 --> 00:03:18.709
A young woman named Psyche handed them ripe pomegranates.

47
00:03:23.832 --> 00:03:25.333
wish the boys were here!"

48
00:03:25.754 --> 00:03:26.674
Kathleen said.

49
00:03:26.694 --> 00:03:30.085
"I wonder what they're doing," said Mabel.

50
00:03:31.265 --> 00:03:32.846
Hermes landed on the grass.

51
00:03:32.866 --> 00:03:37.369
"They climbed out a window, and now they're looking for you."

52
00:03:37.389 --> 00:03:41.612
"It's easy to wish them here," said Apollo.

53
00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:44.314
Kathleen took the ring.

54
00:03:44.334 --> 00:03:51.299
"I wish the boys could be statues of living marble until dawn.

55
00:03:51.739 --> 00:03:55.021
Afterward I want them to return to normal."

56
00:03:55.041 --> 00:03:59.084
"You should have wished them here," said Apollo.

57
00:04:00.652 --> 00:04:03.334
"But Hermes will fetch them and explain everything to them."

58
00:04:05.154 --> 00:04:06.355
He held up the ring.

59
00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:09.297
"The ring is the heart of the magic."

60
00:04:10.457 --> 00:04:12.799
Then he gave the ring back to Kathleen.

61
00:04:12.819 --> 00:04:19.502
"We don't usually question guests," said Hera, the queen of the gods.

62
00:04:19.522 --> 00:04:23.284
"But everyone is interested in your ring.

63
00:04:23.844 --> 00:04:24.825
How did you get it?"

64
00:04:26.286 --> 00:04:27.826
Just then the boys arrived.

65
00:04:29.227 --> 00:04:30.368
They hugged the girls.

66
00:04:33.864 --> 00:04:34.725
They feasted.

67
00:04:35.906 --> 00:04:38.488
Then Mabel told the story of the ring.

68
00:04:38.508 --> 00:04:41.611
"How do you come alive?"

69
00:04:42.171 --> 00:04:43.472
Gerald asked Apollo.

70
00:04:43.493 --> 00:04:48.157
"All statues can do it in the moonlight," said Apollo.

71
00:04:48.177 --> 00:04:51.519
"You've seen us because you wore the ring.

72
00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:56.464
But on one night of the year, anyone can see us in certain temples.

73
00:04:58.445 --> 00:05:01.088
One of those temples is in this great garden."

74
00:05:03.204 --> 00:05:05.146
Then Apollo picked up a lyre.

75
00:05:06.968 --> 00:05:10.030
Kathleen leaned against Psyche as Apollo played.

76
00:05:11.552 --> 00:05:14.915
The music was so beautiful that everyone felt at peace.

77
00:05:19.279 --> 00:05:22.762
Then suddenly Apollo cried, "Dawn is coming!

78
00:05:23.182 --> 00:05:24.123
To your pedestals!"

79
00:05:27.206 --> 00:05:29.228
The gods leaped up and ran away.

80
00:05:34.172 --> 00:05:35.313
"What's the secret of the ring?"

81
00:05:35.333 --> 00:05:38.015
Mabel called after them.

82
00:05:38.035 --> 00:05:43.479
"Ask at the Temple of Strange Stones in five days," said Hermes as he flew away.
